+# `f16b`
+
+The tracking issue for this feature is: [#160630]
+
+[#160630]: https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/160630
+
+---
+
+Enable the `core::num::f16b` type for values stored in the bfloat16 format.
+
+`f16b` is a nominal library type, not a primitive floating-point type: it has no literal suffix, arithmetic operators, or numeric `as` casts. A compiler lang item connects its layout to the chosen backends representation.
